ation` | Builds production services with PATH-aware provider registry. | None. |\n196: \n197: ## Test function inventory\n198: \n199: Only added or meaningfully changed tests and fixture helpers are listed.\n200: \n201: | File | Function | A1 class | Meaning |\n202: |---|---|---|---|\n203: | `crates/oulipoly-provider/tests/client_invoke.rs` | `invoke_describe_accepts_schema_valid_freeform_concurrency_metadata` | `validator` | Proves provider describe accepts schema-valid free-form concurrency metadata. |\n204: | `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_registry.rs` | `binary_ref_resolves_from_process_path_entries` | `validator` | Proves binary provider refs resolve through supplied process PATH entries. |\n205: | `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_registry.rs` | `absent_binary_from_process_path_entries_preserves_missing_artifact` | `validator` | Proves missing binaries remain `missing_artifact`. |\n206: | `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_registry.rs` | `unset_process_path_entries_preserves_missing_artifact_without_panic` | `validator` | Proves unset PATH is safe and non-resolving. |\n207: | `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_settings_host.rs` | `settings_host_preserves_conflict_error_details_and_diagnostics` | `validator` | Proves provider settings preserves provider capability details, diagnostics, and typed process status. |\n208: | `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/s10_external_launch_session.rs` | `external_launch_exit_session_populates_capture_and_resume_request` | `validator` | Proves protocol shape, PATH preservation, launch session capture, and known-session relaunch. |\n209: | `src-tauri/tests/age244_s7b_production_wiring_source_guard.rs` | `s10_production_provider_registries_populate_path_entries_from_process_path` | `validator` | Proves production registry constructors opt into process PATH entries. |\n210: | `src-tauri/tests/s10_external_provider_resume.rs` | `external_provider_resume_without_rotate_uses_external_launch_and_recorded_cwd` | `